source: crates/instrukt-cli/tests/harness.rs
expression: help
---
Scheduled tick status

Usage: instrukt ticks <COMMAND>

Commands:
  status  Show the last wake-up and the disk-headroom guard's last run
  help    Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help     Print help
  -V, --version  Print version
